r","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-06-14T07:41:28Z","updated_at":"2026-06-16T17:51:55Z","closed_at":"2026-06-16T17:51:55Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.7-dev4 (and above)\n- Not reproducible in: 4.7-dev3 (and below)\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.dev4.mono - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060 SUPER (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9595) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-10700F CPU @ 2.90GHz (16 threads) - 31.77 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen using Jolt physics, dynamically changing gravity vector no longer works - rigid bodies, after waking, either don't follow the new gravity, or follow it only after scene restart, or randomly.\n\n```\nPhysicsServer3D.AreaSetParam(GetWorld3D().Space, PhysicsServer3D.AreaParameter.GravityVector, targetGravity);\n```\n\n```\nprivate void WakeAllRigidBodies(Node node)\n    {\n        foreach (Node child in node.GetChildren())\n        {\n            if (child is RigidBody3D rigidBody)\n            {\n                GD.Print(\"Waking rigid body: \", rigidBody.Name);\n                rigidBody.Sleeping = false;\n            }\n            WakeAllRigidBodies(child); // Recursively check all children\n        }\n    }\n```\n\nThis may have started happening after https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118197\n\nDoes not happen if using the default Godot physics engine.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nPlease see MRP:\n\nRun the main scene, then press Space to flip gravity direction\n\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[gravity-bug-mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/28924156/gravity-bug-mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120279/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120279/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}